;</li><li>the annual rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in a reference month compared to the same month of the previous year (also called annual inflation)&nbsp;</li><li>the monthly rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in consumer price indices in a reference month compared to the previous month (also called monthly inflation)</li><li>the 12-month average rate of change,&nbsp;comparing the average index over a 12-month period to the average index previous 12-month period.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>All the rates are calculated from the monthly HICP indices.&nbsp;</p>","id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"23.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2026-01-27T09:31:20+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-back